  "description": "Grip a wellplate with the right arm at hold_plate and hold it in place, then pinch the exposed mat corner with the left arm at seal_approach_1 and advance through seal_approach_2/3/4/5 along the diagonal peel path. No lift, no retract, no full peel yet.",
